Description: Antibiotic susceptibility test results of 50 Pseudomonas
    aeruginosa isolates from surface water at seven sites along the Buriganga
    River, Bangladesh, tested against nine antibiotics by disc diffusion, with
    a summary per isolate and the zone diameter breakpoints used. The data are
    republished from the supplementary tables of Sharif, Amin, Mehbub and
    Ratul (2024) <doi:10.2166/wh.2024.270>, Journal of Water and Health,
    CC BY 4.0.
